th doing in The Summit at Snoqualmie?","a":"Point it down Alpental. 2,280 ft of vertical and some of the steepest lift-served terrain in Washington — the expert''s mountain across the freeway, with in-area steeps and (guided, NWAC-gated) sidecountry for the strong.","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Summit_at_Snoqualmie","accessed":"2026-07-13"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"The Summit at Snoqualmie Ski Guide: Seattle''s Home Mountain, Night Skiing & Alpental","meta_description":"Plan The Summit at Snoqualmie, Washington — the closest major ski area to Seattle on I-90 (Boyne/Ikon), four base areas, the biggest night skiing in America, a huge learn-to-ski and tubing operation, and the serious steeps of Alpental, with real timing, Cascade-snow + avalanche + WSDOT I-90 pass-driving safety and booking intel.","slug":"summit-at-snoqualmie-washington","primary_keyword":"Summit at Snoqualmie ski guide","long_tail":["Summit at Snoqualmie night skiing","skiing near Seattle Snoqualmie Pass","Alpental steep skiing Washington","Summit at Snoqualmie learn to ski","Summit Tubing Center Snoqualmie","I-90 Snoqualmie Pass ski conditions"],"search_language":"es-US","local_keywords":["esqui en Summit at Snoqualmie","esquiar cerca de Seattle","esqui nocturno en Washington","aprender a esquiar cerca de Seattle","tubing en la nieve Snoqualmie","condiciones del paso I-90 Snoqualmie"],"hreflang":["en","es-US"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-13","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-13","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.u